  "bodyHash": "Mv0KNS+cFnE=",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/resourcepackoverrides/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/resourcepackoverrides/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/resourcepackoverrides/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">資源包覆寫（Resource Pack Overrides）</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">讓模組包創作者能完全控制預先安裝的資源包在 Minecraft 中的呈現與管理方式。它協助確保重要資源包能依照預期配置，同時保持資源包介面整潔易用。🎨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">與直接提供預設資源包配置不同，本模組能在資源重新載入失敗後自動恢復偏好的資源包設定，幫助維持玩家一致的遊戲體驗。🔄</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">此模組還能隱藏、鎖定、重新排序資源包，或將其標記為相容，讓你輕鬆打造精緻的模組包，玩家只會看到他們應該互動的選項。🧰</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/resourcepackoverrides/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">持久預設資源包配置：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">定義一組預設的資源包及其順序，可在資源包載入重置時恢復。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🔒 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">鎖定重要資源包：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">防止關鍵資源包被停用或移動。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">👁️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">隱藏內部資源包：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">將技術性或背景資源包從選擇畫面中隱藏。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📋 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">自訂資源包顯示：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">覆寫名稱、描述、相容性警告及其他資源包屬性。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">控制資源包排序：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">定義資源包出現的位置及其與其他啟用資源的互動方式。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">更簡潔的資源包介面：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">減少雜亂，幫助玩家避免意外變更重要的資源包配置。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚙️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">專為模組包打造：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">專門為管理模組化 Minecraft 中精心挑選的資源包配置而設計。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/resourcepackoverrides/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/resourcepackoverrides/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/resourcepackoverrides/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/resourcepackoverrides/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">用戶端需安裝</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> (Fabric 版本)</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/resourcepackoverrides/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">整個模組透過單一設定檔進行配置，位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config/resourcepackoverrides.json</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。當該檔案遺失時，會自動產生最小配置。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">詳細文件、配置範例及所有可用選項，請參閱 GitHub 上的 </span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">README.md</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/resourcepackoverrides/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/bloomcraft\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bloomcraft/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchantment-insights\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantmentinsights/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalfences/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/resourcepackoverrides/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/resourcepackoverrides/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
